=== 12: declare -t - enables trace for specific function
status: 0
bash-n: 0
--- stdout
|[debug: declare -t traced_func]
|[debug: echo "calling untraced"]
|calling untraced
|[debug: untraced_func]
|in untraced
|[debug: echo "calling traced"]
|calling traced
|[debug: traced_func]
|in traced
|[debug: echo "done"]
|done

=== 13: declare +t - disables trace for specific function
